Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.78,0:08:25.53,Vigne,Vigne,0,0,0,,Vậy gọi mình là Vigne nha.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:23.78,0:08:25.53,Vigne - BG,Vigne,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Vậy gọi mình là Vigne nha.
